    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game purpose: Who can spend the least time climbing to the top of the Fantasy Tower? </h2><br>Work hard to climb the tower and unlock more game features<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> You can sleep in your home to restore your health and status, you can also store your equipment in your home, and you can even synthesize items </ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> You can exercise in the academy to increase attributes, learn skills, and conduct trials</ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> You can buy and sell in the store and work to earn gold coins </ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> You can collect materials to synthesize items </ul><br>You need to improve the character's attributes through careful arrangements, so as to defeat the enemies in the fantasy tower in the least amount of time.<br><br>The current 1.2 version of Fantasy Tower has only been developed to 6 floors. It will be opened in the future. Feedback from players needs to be collected to adjust the content that will be released later.<br><br>Code is open source\uff1a<br>",
